  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing CSS Styles**\n\nI\'m currently focused on `src/index.css`. I\'ve added the `@custom-variant dark` rule as per the design instructions. Next, I plan to set up custom styles for mystical animations and glassmorphism effects, following frontend-design guidelines to enhance visual appeal.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1183343"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));\\n\\n@layer base {\\n  body {\\n    font-family: \'Plus Jakarta Sans\', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\\n  }\\n  \\n  .font-magic {\\n    font-family: \'Cinzel\', serif;\\n  }\\n\\n  .font-code {\\n    font-family: \'Fira Code\', monospace;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/* Mystical Glow & Ambient Styles */\\n.magic-glow-cyan {\\n  box-shadow: 0 0 25px -3px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4), 0 0 10px -2px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);\\n}\\n\\n.magic-glow-purple {\\n  box-shadow: 0 0 30px -4px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.45), 0 0 12px -2px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);\\n}\\n\\n.magic-glow-gold {\\n  box-shadow: 0 0 25px -2px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45), 0 0 10px -1px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);\\n}\\n\\n.glass-panel {\\n  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);\\n  backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\\n}\\n\\n.glass-panel-elevated {\\n  background: rgba(22, 30, 56, 0.82);\\n  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.2);\\n}\\n\\n/* Custom Scrollbar for Chat & Tables */\\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\\n  width: 6px;\\n  height: 6px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\\n  background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.8);\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\\n  background: rgba(76, 29, 149, 0.5);\\n  border-radius: 9999px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\\n  background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.6);\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Update src/index.css with dark variant, fonts, glassmorphism and glow styles\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/index.css\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating src/index.css\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update src/index.css\"}"
