  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing UI Components**\n\nI\'m starting to sketch out the UI components, focusing on `src/components/`. The core will be `Header.tsx`, envisioned as a mystical header with a starry logo, the title \"\320\241\320\270\322\233\321\213\321\200\320\273\321\213 \320\272\320\265\321\201\321\202\320\265,\" an audio mute toggle, and a \"\320\244\" element. I\'m keen to make the design visually appealing and functionally robust.\n\n\n**Refining UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now refining the top bar with an \"\320\276\320\272\321\203\321\201\321\202\321\213 \321\202\320\265\320\272\321\201\320\265\321\200\321\203 / \320\242\321\200\320\265\320\275\320\260\320\266\320\265\321\200\" toggle. I\'ve also drafted the `InstructionBanner.tsx`, which will guide users through the process with interactive steps. I\'ve started structuring `MagicTable.tsx`, aiming for a responsive, clean layout with five columns on desktop and a scrollable or wrapping grid on mobile. Each column will have a header and a numerical grid with an \"active\" toggle button.\n\n\n**Developing Action Controls**\n\nI\'m presently focusing on `ActionControls.tsx`. I\'m designing primary buttons for \"Reveal Number,\" \"Restart,\" and a toggle for \"Reveal/Hide Secret.\" I\'m also including an \"Interactive Trainer\" button. The secret reveal will feature glowing elements, with the key section initially veiled and later radiant in \"Reveal Secret\" mode.\n\n\n**Crafting Chatbot Interactions**\n\nI\'m now diving into `VirtualMagicianChat.tsx`. I\'m creating a virtual magician avatar with an animated aura and iconic wizard accessories. The first step involves the user selecting columns and clicking \"Reveal Number.\" The magician will then produce a typing animation, followed by a relevant prediction in Kazakh. If no columns are selected, the magician will prompt the user to make a selection. I\'m also planning the reveal-the-secret sequence with an interactive Kazakh explanation.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1036207"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { Sparkles, Volume2, VolumeX, BookOpen, Wand2 } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { soundManager } from \'../utils/soundEffects\';\\n\\ninterface HeaderProps {\\n  isMuted: boolean;\\n  onToggleMute: () => void;\\n  showTrainer: boolean;\\n  onToggleTrainer: () => void;\\n  onOpenRules: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Header: React.FC<HeaderProps> = ({\\n  isMuted,\\n  onToggleMute,\\n  showTrainer,\\n  onToggleTrainer,\\n  onOpenRules,\\n}) => {\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"w-full border-b border-purple-900/40 bg-[#0b0f19]/80 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-30\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-4\\\">\\n        {/* Zone 1: Brand title */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-tr from-purple-600 to-cyan-400 p-[1px] flex items-center justify-center magic-glow-cyan\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"w-full h-full bg-[#0b0f19] rounded-[7px] flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n              <Sparkles className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400 animate-pulse\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <span className=\\\"font-magic text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold tracking-wider bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-300 via-purple-300 to-amber-200 bg-clip-text text-transparent whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n            \320\241\320\230\322\232\320\253\320\240\320\233\320\253 \320\232\320\225\320\241\320\242\320\225\\n          </span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 2: Navigation / Info */}\\n        <div className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenRules}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n          >\\n            <BookOpen className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-purple-400\\\" />\\n            <span>\320\225\321\200\320\265\320\266\320\265\321\201\321\226</span>\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onToggleTrainer}\\n            className={`flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap ${\\n              showTrainer ? \'text-amber-300 font-semibold\' : \'hover:text-cyan-300\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            <Wand2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400\\\" />\\n            <span>\320\242\321\200\320\265\320\275\320\260\320\266\320\265\321\200 \321\200\320\265\320\266\320\270\320\274\321\226</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 3: Actions (Sound toggle & Trainer button on mobile) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onToggleTrainer}\\n            className={`md:hidden px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-lg border transition-all cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap ${\\n              showTrainer\\n                ? \'bg-amber-500/20 border-amber-400 text-amber-200\'\\n                : \'bg-purple-950/40 border-purple-800/50 text-slate-300 hover:text-white\'\\n            }`}\\n            title=\\\"\320\241\320\260\320\275\320\264\321\213 \321\202\320\265\320\272\321\201\320\265\321\200\321\203 \321\202\321\200\320\265\320\275\320\260\320\266\320\265\321\200\321\226\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Wand2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 inline mr-1 text-cyan-400\\\" />\\n            <span>\320\242\321\200\320\265\320\275\320\260\320\266\320\265\321\200</span>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => {\\n              onToggleMute();\\n              soundManager.playSelect(550);\\n            }}\\n            aria-label={isMuted ? \'\320\224\321\213\320\261\321\213\321\201\321\202\321\213 \322\233\320\276\321\201\321\203\' : \'\320\224\321\213\320\261\321\213\321\201\321\202\321\213 \323\251\321\210\321\226\321\200\321\203\'}\\n            className=\\\"p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:text-cyan-300 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            title={isMuted ? \'\320\224\321\213\320\261\321\213\321\201\321\202\321\213 \322\233\320\276\321\201\321\203\' : \'\320\224\321\213\320\261\321\213\321\201\321\202\321\213 \323\251\321\210\321\226\321\200\321\203\'}\\n          >\\n            {isMuted ? (\\n              <VolumeX className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-500\\\" />\\n            ) : (\\n              <Volume2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400\\\" />\\n            )}\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create Header component with clean top bar contract\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Header.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating Header.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create Header.tsx component\"}"
