  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Building the Table Structure**\n\nI\'m now focused on constructing the `MagicTable.tsx` component. The structure necessitates a 5-column table, and within each column, 16 numbers are listed in top-to-bottom order. I\'m carefully reviewing the requirements and starting to outline the component\'s basic structure and data population.\n\n\n**Defining Column Properties**\n\nI\'ve moved on to defining the specific properties of each column now, and I\'m outlining how the number placement and hidden keys will work. I\'m focusing on the interactive elements, like the \"\320\234\320\265\320\275\321\226\322\243 \321\201\320\260\320\275\321\213\320\274 \320\276\321\201\321\213\320\275\320\264\320\260\" button and how the neon glow will be implemented upon selection. I\'m also considering the sound feedback for interactions.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1126602"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { MAGIC_COLUMNS, MagicColumn } from \'../utils/magicTable\';\\nimport { Check, Lock, KeyRound } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { soundManager } from \'../utils/soundEffects\';\\n\\ninterface MagicTableProps {\\n  selectedColumnIds: number[];\\n  onToggleColumn: (columnId: number) => void;\\n  isSecretRevealed: boolean;\\n  highlightedNumber?: number | null;\\n}\\n\\nexport const MagicTable: React.FC<MagicTableProps> = ({\\n  selectedColumnIds,\\n  onToggleColumn,\\n  isSecretRevealed,\\n  highlightedNumber = null,\\n}) => {\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"w-full\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-3 sm:gap-4\\\">\\n        {MAGIC_COLUMNS.map((column: MagicColumn) => {\\n          const isSelected = selectedColumnIds.includes(column.id);\\n\\n          return (\\n            <div\\n              key={column.id}\\n              className={`relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden border ${\\n                isSelected\\n                  ? \'bg-gradient-to-b from-[#141b36] to-[#0c1022] border-cyan-400 magic-glow-cyan scale-[1.02] z-10\'\\n                  : \'bg-[#0f172a]/70 border-slate-800/80 hover:border-purple-500/40 hover:bg-[#131b33]/60\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              {/* Column Top Header */}\\n              <div\\n                className={`px-3 py-2.5 flex items-center justify-between border-b transition-colors ${\\n                  isSelected\\n                    ? \'border-cyan-500/40 bg-cyan-950/30 text-cyan-200\'\\n                    : \'border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 text-slate-300\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-magic font-bold text-sm sm:text-base\\\">\\n                    {column.title}\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n                {isSelected && (\\n                  <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-cyan-400 animate-pulse\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 inline-block\\\" />\\n                    \320\242\320\260\322\243\320\264\320\260\320\273\320\264\321\213\\n                  </span>\\n                )}\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Numbers Grid (16 numbers: 2 columns x 8 rows) */}\\n              <div className=\\\"p-3 grow flex flex-col justify-center\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5 text-center\\\">\\n                  {column.numbers.map((num) => {\\n                    const isCellHighlighted = highlightedNumber === num;\\n\\n                    return (\\n                      <div\\n                        key={num}\\n                        className={`py-1 px-1.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums font-mono transition-all duration-200 ${\\n                          isCellHighlighted\\n                            ? \'bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-bold scale-110 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/50 z-20 ring-2 ring-amber-300\'\\n                            : isSelected\\n                            ? \'bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-100 hover:bg-cyan-500/20\'\\n                            : \'bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-800/80 hover:text-white\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        {num}\\n                      </div>\\n                    );\\n                  })}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Interactive Button: \302\253\320\234\320\265\320\275\321\226\322\243 \321\201\320\260\320\275\321\213\320\274 \320\276\321\201\321\213\320\275\320\264\320\260\302\273 */}\\n              <div className=\\\"p-2.5 border-t border-slate-800/70 bg-slate-950/40\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => {\\n                    onToggleColumn(column.id);\\n                    soundManager.playSelect(isSelected ? 380 : 540);\\n                  }}\\n                  className={`w-full py-2.5 px-3 rounded-xl font-medium text-xs sm:text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                    isSelected\\n                      ? \'bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 text-slate-950 font-bold shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/30\'\\n                      : \'bg-slate-900 hover:bg-purple-900/40 text-slate-300 hover:text-white border border-slate-700/60 hover:border-purple-500/40\'\\n                  }`}\\n                  aria-pressed={isSelected}\\n                  aria-label={`${column.title}: \320\234\320\265\320\275\321\226\322\243 \321\201\320\260\320\275\321\213\320\274 \320\276\321\201\321\213\320\275\320\264\320\260`}\\n                >\\n                  <div\\n                    className={`w-4 h-4 rounded flex items-center justify-center transition-colors ${\\n                      isSelected\\n                        ? \'bg-slate-950 text-cyan-300\'\\n                        : \'border border-slate-600\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    {isSelected && <Check className=\\\"w-3 h-3 stroke-[3]\\\" />}\\n                  </div>\\n                  <span>\320\234\320\265\320\275\321\226\322\243 \321\201\320\260\320\275\321\213\320\274 \320\276\321\201\321\213\320\275\320\264\320\260</span>\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Bottom Hidden Key Indicator */}\\n              <div\\n                className={`py-2 px-3 text-center border-t transition-all duration-500 ${\\n                  isSecretRevealed\\n                    ? isSelected\\n                      ? \'bg-amber-500/20 border-amber-500/40 text-amber-300 magic-glow-gold\'\\n                      : \'bg-purple-950/40 border-purple-800/40 text-purple-300\'\\n                    : \'bg-slate-950/80 border-slate-900 text-slate-600\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                {isSecretRevealed ? (\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                    <KeyRound className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400\\\" />\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold font-mono\\\">\\n                      \320\232\321\226\320\273\321\202: <strong className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-amber-300\\\">{column.key}</strong>\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono ml-1\\\">\\n                      (2^{column.powerOfTwo})\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                ) : (\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-slate-500 text-xs\\\">\\n                    <Lock className=\\\"w-3 h-3 opacity-60\\\" />\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-[11px] tracking-wide\\\">\322\232\322\261\320\277\320\270\321\217 \320\272\321\226\320\273\321\202</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                )}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          );\\n        })}\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create MagicTable component displaying 5 columns with 16 numbers and interactive neon selection\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/MagicTable.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating MagicTable.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create MagicTable.tsx component\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\316\017\n\313\017\001i\024}\023\256c)QW\267\271\225\334\357\346\352w\312\372Uh\r\024+\a{\001 \207\266;@\375\355\'\313\357\323\020\003N\032\251\207\313BUN\342=\a\347\027\021\321\343Tc\272B\241?\025eW<\271W\273c\305,\020\321\272@\314zn&\300\271\2479\253\210v\313\216\272\220\317\222\031\033\321\260\032\313\214\336u\215\200A+A,\377(7\030}\033\\\243\220\364\304>\270\bP\277\024\225e\314\376\211\200\210\372\23183-q\300\202\0339\234\240%\345\022\320B\020\020\232\200w3\233Q\0315F\364\305\3714\203N\315L\371\032a\001\242/\v0\036\277\225/\023C\341.eBv!\317\223\205\244a\343\237m\371r\327O\325I\236\325\322\306\324*X50\234\357\316q\rB\"\326\244\"\fv\242\025\002\253\216\353\\\273\022\271/\335%\255\232P\302\275\3358\341\342TA\225\364\003\005\261\365\267\352\261d\312\363vPp\036z\236x\241\317\274\"\002\252\ay\001\"\300w\334Qw\241\026\033YD\344T\301\362\363\305x\331\200\r\226S\264\355\'A\t{k\311LS\2723S\335@\333H\300\373\330\273\352\315^4\351\275\322\031&\227\2267\177\265C\322O\304\032\365\235? \262\177\003\235\0269 XwXt$\335 \212\235u\247\206\334\234\264\315\265\311\235\211\020?\034\004\306\256\2774V\177\367\006\256\f\360H\\\022\371x\336\237\374\351X\254 \245\246c+umxi\217L.xT\375\030m\v\357M\361}\357_=.\373?\373|\324Si\017\265\301\341\322\a!\250\310\244\232\221\327ywPW-\206\335\316\025\274\312\342\215[\033F\362\266\364;\n\275\020U%\227&\0315\310l-\252\302/\235\f\335\240jc\351\033\245\017\f\266\267\000\342\f,\033\036yf\250\023\356[{~\306\376\347\350$\343\336?\225M\261\025x\037\203%\000\n\245\\I\354taV}\"\021\340N\025\340W\325w|\264*\305\302\360\n\022\325T1\221t\024\362\370E\000\017\204\345\330M\203\202j\323\203EZ(\366\022\206\264\033\256\tr\270\026\300$\210\335/\nl\324\035\316\352\033\220\257\300 \354\356V\032\2127yB\245\000\234\030\256\204;TU#\376\034\366R\034\270\277\207\020\246C\023\217\256\320\213\361\263\3715\351\362\216\255\f\247M\213o\331\f\322p\at\ah\004yA<\177\364\366F\"\344\353\004\346\257\321:\221\222K<\022\bd\230|\264.\267\330\246b\360\257\2