  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Component Structure**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the `SecretExplanationCard.tsx` component. The key requirement is to implement the \"3-\322\233\320\260\320\264\320\260\320\274 (\320\234\320\260\321\202\320\265\320\274\320\260\321\202\320\270\320\272\320\260\320\273\321\213\322\233 \321\202\322\257\321\201\321\226\320\275\320\264\321\226\321\200\320\274\320\265)\" functionality, specifically revealing the hidden key numbers below the table when the user clicks a button. The structure of the component is starting to take shape.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1253553"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { Lightbulb, Binary, Cpu, Calculator } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { MAGIC_COLUMNS, getMathFormula } from \'../utils/magicTable\';\\n\\ninterface SecretExplanationCardProps {\\n  selectedColumnIds: number[];\\n  guessedNumber: number | null;\\n}\\n\\nexport const SecretExplanationCard: React.FC<SecretExplanationCardProps> = ({\\n  selectedColumnIds,\\n  guessedNumber,\\n}) => {\\n  const formulaInfo = getMathFormula(selectedColumnIds);\\n  const displayNum = guessedNumber !== null ? guessedNumber : formulaInfo.total;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl glass-panel-elevated p-5 sm:p-6 mb-8 border border-amber-500/30 magic-glow-gold transition-all duration-500\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-4 border-b border-slate-700/60 mb-5\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"p-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/40\\\">\\n            <Lightbulb className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-400\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-amber-200\\\">\\n              \320\244\320\276\320\272\321\203\321\201\321\202\321\213\322\243 \320\274\320\260\321\202\320\265\320\274\320\260\321\202\320\270\320\272\320\260\320\273\321\213\322\233 \322\233\322\261\320\277\320\270\321\217\321\201\321\213\\n            </h3>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n              \320\225\320\272\321\226\320\273\321\226\320\272 \321\201\320\260\320\275\320\260\321\203 \320\266\322\257\320\271\320\265\321\201\321\226 (Binary code) \320\266\323\231\320\275\320\265 2-\320\275\321\226\322\243 \320\264\323\231\321\200\320\265\320\266\320\265\320\273\320\265\321\200\321\226\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {displayNum > 0 && (\\n          <div className=\\\"px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-cyan-950/80 border border-cyan-500/40 text-cyan-200 text-sm font-mono flex items-center gap-2 self-start md:self-auto\\\">\\n            <span>\320\242\320\260\322\243\320\264\320\260\320\273\322\223\320\260\320\275 \321\201\320\260\320\275:</span>\\n            <strong className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-cyan-300 tabular-nums\\\">{displayNum}</strong>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Visual Bits Breakdown */}\\n      <div className=\\\"mb-6\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n          <Binary className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400\\\" />\\n          <span>\320\225\320\272\321\226\320\273\321\226\320\272 \321\200\320\260\320\267\321\200\321\217\320\264\321\202\320\260\321\200 \320\274\320\265\320\275 \321\201\320\260\320\273\320\274\320\260\322\233\321\202\320\260\321\200 \320\272\320\265\321\201\321\202\320\265\321\201\321\226:</span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-5 gap-2 sm:gap-3 text-center\\\">\\n          {MAGIC_COLUMNS.map((col, idx) => {\\n            const isBitActive = selectedColumnIds.includes(col.id);\\n\\n            return (\\n              <div\\n                key={col.id}\\n                className={`p-2.5 sm:p-3 rounded-xl border transition-all ${\\n                  isBitActive\\n                    ? \'bg-cyan-500/20 border-cyan-400 text-white shadow-md shadow-cyan-500/20\'\\n                    : \'bg-slate-900/60 border-slate-800 text-slate-400\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-medium\\\">\\n                  {col.title}\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"text-base sm:text-xl font-bold font-mono my-0.5 text-amber-300\\\">\\n                  {col.key}\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">\\n                  2^{col.powerOfTwo}\\n                </div>\\n                <div\\n                  className={`mt-2 py-0.5 px-1.5 rounded text-xs font-bold font-mono ${\\n                    isBitActive\\n                      ? \'bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950\'\\n                      : \'bg-slate-800 text-slate-500\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  {isBitActive ? \'1 (\320\261\320\260\321\200)\' : \'0 (\320\266\320\276\322\233)\'}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Formula Box */}\\n      {displayNum > 0 ? (\\n        <div className=\\\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-cyan-500/30 mb-5\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1\\\">\\n            <Calculator className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400\\\" />\\n            <span>\320\234\320\260\321\202\320\265\320\274\320\260\321\202\320\270\320\272\320\260\320\273\321\213\322\233 \322\233\320\276\321\201\321\213\320\275\320\264\321\213:</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"text-lg sm:text-2xl font-bold font-mono text-cyan-300 tracking-wide\\\">\\n            {formulaInfo.formulaText}\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 font-mono flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1\\\">\\n            <span>\320\224\323\231\321\200\320\265\320\266\320\265\320\273\320\265\321\200 \321\202\322\257\321\200\321\226\320\275\320\264\320\265: {formulaInfo.powersExplanation}</span>\\n            <span>\302\267</span>\\n            <span>\320\225\320\272\321\226\320\273\321\226\320\272 \320\272\320\276\320\264\321\213: <span className=\\\"text-amber-300 font-bold\\\">{formulaInfo.binaryRepresentation}\342\202\202</span></span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      ) : (\\n        <div className=\\\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 mb-5 text-sm text-slate-400\\\">\\n          \320\232\320\265\321\201\321\202\320\265\320\264\320\265\320\275 \321\201\320\260\320\275\321\213\322\243\321\213\320\267 \320\261\320\260\321\200 \320\261\320\260\322\223\320\260\320\275\320\264\320\260\321\200\320\264\321\213 \321\202\320\260\322\243\320\264\320\260\322\243\321\213\320\267, \321\201\320\276\320\275\320\264\320\260 \320\264\323\231\320\273 \320\276\321\201\321\213 \320\266\320\265\321\200\320\264\320\265 \322\233\320\276\321\201\321\213\320\275\320\264\321\213 \321\204\320\276\321\200\320\274\321\203\320\273\320\260\321\201\321\213 \320\277\320\260\320\271\320\264\320\260 \320\261\320\276\320\273\320\260\320\264\321\213!\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Core Educational Text in Kazakh */}\\n      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed bg-slate-950/40 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"font-semibold text-cyan-300 flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n            <Binary className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400\\\" />\\n            <span>\320\235\320\265\320\263\320\265 \320\261\322\261\320\273 \323\231\321\200\322\233\320\260\321\210\320\260\320\275 \320\274\321\226\320\275\321\201\321\226\320\267 \320\266\322\261\320\274\321\213\321\201 \321\226\321\201\321\202\320\265\320\271\320\264\321\226?</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <p>\\n            \320\232\320\265\320\267 \320\272\320\265\320\273\320\263\320\265\320\275 \320\261\322\257\321\202\321\226\320\275 \321\201\320\260\320\275\320\264\321\213 2-\320\275\321\226\322\243 \320\264\323\231\321\200\320\265\320\266\320\265\320\273\320\265\321\200\321\226\320\275\321\226\322\243 (<strong className=\\\"text-amber-300 font-mono\\\">1, 2, 4, 8, 16</strong>) \322\233\320\276\321\201\321\213\320\275\320\264\321\213\321\201\321\213 \321\202\322\257\321\200\321\226\320\275\320\264\320\265 \\n            <strong> \320\261\321\226\321\200 \322\223\320\260\320\275\320\260 \322\233\320\260\320\271\321\202\320\260\320\273\320\260\320\275\320\261\320\260\321\201 \321\202\323\231\321\201\321\226\320\273\320\274\320\265\320\275</strong> \320\266\320\260\320\267\321\203\322\223\320\260 \320\261\320\276\320\273\320\260\320\264\321\213. \320\221\322\261\320\273 \342\200\224 \320\274\320\260\321\202\320\265\320\274\320\260\321\202\320\270\320\272\320\260\320\275\321\213\322\243 \320\275\320\265\320\263\321\226\320\267\320\263\321\226 \320\260\320\272\321\201\320\270\320\276\320\274\320\260\320\273\320\260\321\200\321\213\320\275\321\213\322\243 \320\261\321\226\321\200\321\226.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"font-semibold text-purple-300 flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n            <Cpu className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-purple-400\\\" />\\n            <span>\320\232\320\276\320\274\320\277\321\214\321\216\321\202\320\265\321\200\320\273\320\265\321\200 \320\264\320\265 \320\276\321\201\321\213\320\273\320\260\320\271 \320\266\322\261\320\274\321\213\321\201 \321\226\321\201\321\202\320\265\320\271\320\264\321\226:</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <p>\\n            \320\241\320\274\320\260\321\200\321\202\321\204\320\276\320\275\320\264\320\260\321\200 \320\274\320\265\320\275 \320\267\320\260\320\274\320\260\320\275\320\260\321\203\320\270 \320\272\320\276\320\274\320\277\321\214\321\216\321\202\320\265\321\200\320\273\320\265\321\200 \320\261\322\257\320\272\321\226\320\273 \320\274\323\231\321\202\321\226\320\275\320\264\321\226, \321\201\321\203\321\200\320\265\321\202\321\202\320\265\321\200 \320\274\320\265\320\275 \320\276\320\271\321\213\320\275\320\264\320\260\321\200\320\264\321\213 \320\264\323\231\320\273 \320\276\321\201\321\213 0 \320\274\320\265\320\275 1 (\320\261\320\270\321\202\321\202\320\265\321\200) \321\202\322\257\321\200\321\226\320\275\320\264\320\265 \321\201\320\260\322\233\321\202\320\260\320\271\320\264\321\213. \\n            \320\221\320\260\322\223\320\260\320\275 \321\202\320\260\322\243\320\264\320\260\320\273\321\201\320\260 \342\200\224 \320\261\322\261\320\273 <span className=\\\"text-cyan-300 font-mono font-bold\\\">1</span> (\321\201\320\270\320\263\320\275\320\260\320\273 \320\261\320\260\321\200), \321\202\320\260\322\243\320\264\320\260\320\273\320\274\320\260\321\201\320\260 \342\200\224 <span className=\\\"text-slate-400 font-mono font-bold\\\">0</span> (\321\201\320\270\320\263\320\275\320\260\320\273 \320\266\320\276\322\233).\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create SecretExplanationCard component explaining binary representation and powers of two in Kazakh\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/SecretExplanationCard.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating SecretExplanationCard.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create SecretExplanationCard.tsx component\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\341\v\n\336\v\001i\024}\023:w\325\246\255p\f\335\337\345\234\301Z\240\266\326\215\224F\237&o\213\376\211E\333\215\320\032\324\247\001\0259\361\253\023\017\222\262\305\002AEQ\347\362K\335\250\337\345\307W\237x\315|\241\330\244\022\b:\277<+\267C\316\025\270\345\201!{l\240\321xCm\331\316\254\357=\221\242\221gv\023m\'{\033\021\216\022_\r\362q\024\233\342\343\341\360\213as\002\3269\335q\224/\205A\345\2502?\326\331T\001\304\303\b\237Sy\315\022\230;\335\256V/\276\363\3317c\aw\"\267r\a\335\246\r\177d\003\315 \260\030\352\243.\232\260\004x\264_r\274V\251\001\305\246\267\346\026~r\017,\331\201\341\237\234\232?\267\222%Q\003\237-+.\026\v\370\003p\203t\032\226it\204\b\327\236\301\330\342\333N\036i\341\207\206h\020\246\024\310((p\306q\343\241\224\257\355\'\226\210\317\315\261L4\3354.\344\252c\3073\323!\337\034>\270\215\261k\031\316\210K\a1\314tL\2510\372\326e\033\363\357\314tr=7 9K\f\252\346\272\344\030P;\202\256PA\000\214\322\277\027\033\272\373\265\307\3032\373\006\355z\265\311\273\215\r\243\304\310\303\324\'^6\026\"\273k\004@\347\301\r\370O\\\270I^0,)\212\204E\263\304\240\251\3775E\226b)\210ZR\031\344s\375V\224gDy&*p[S\333\342\f\034\331y[\353m\356\323\345\246\260\004\275\346\277U\327W\t\324\374\265\301\016\233\245g\377\302\207\023\374\357\2004oK\207\367v\262\260\223$\027\2122?\277:\364\211\315\002\325\314\002\035\221\314\253&\230\336\212\377\016V\037\020E\316Yk&\3052W\266?$\206nS\251\f\330.\333\302\034\373\337\225\327\354\275=\2248rC=\031\301\234\226\216\225\304;A\311\3714=\316\223\276/\231TEao:\035\367\021\356\377A\332[`\360\242\303\204\267\304\233B\253\262M\024=\177\357.\n\262\317\267L\362\003t\372T \217\220d/M\201\004\306\020T\253\232\tf#\370\233\301+e\0246\367_\262\231\320}l\206\327 \305\323\025\272\t\252\351\221\343<\006{\a8Bv\202\252\226\"\\\262\230\020\272|b\250Y\314\030\336\205O\272\346\260\313[\372\034\t\251\022\326\250G\346\"l\362\253\355_\205h\273\337\276\224\033\316\377F;(\002\266\204\246\b5\221+\370R\017\252\033\352\232H\310\331\23