    thinking: "**Constructing Component Now**\n\nI\'m now diving into building `src/components/VirtualMagicianChat.tsx`. Currently, I\'m meticulously verifying each step requested in the prompt. I\'ve begun with the first step, focusing on how the user\'s column selections should result in the display of a \"Know the Number\" button.\n\n\n**Unveiling The Magic**\n\nNow, I\'m integrating the core logic. When a user activates the button, I\'ll calculate the sum of selected column keys (16, 8, 4, 2, 1). Subsequently, I will display the \"Abracadabra! \342\234\250 I\'ve read your mind. You thought of [CALCULATED NUMBER]!\" message, complete with a typing animation in the chat. If no columns are selected, a prompt to choose will be displayed. I\'ll ask, \"Want to know how this trick works?\" and present a \"Yes, reveal the secret! \360\237\224\223\" button. The last step, showing key numbers, will come after the user clicks that button.\n\n\n**Explaining the Algorithm**\n\nI\'m now detailing the \"Secret Reveal\" section. I will display the selected numbers (16, 8, 4, 2, 1) visually. I\'ll show the sum in formula form (e.g., 13 as 8 + 4 + 1 = 13). The explanation will be simple, highlighting the powers of 2 (binary system) and how computers use this principle. I\'m also adding a chat input field for queries. I\'m integrating Gemini API key configuration and fallback logic for local, smart responses. I\'ll add preset quick questions as well.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1214578"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState, useEffect, useRef } from \'react\';\\nimport { Send, Bot, Sparkles, Unlock, HelpCircle, Loader2 } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { soundManager } from \'../utils/soundEffects\';\\n\\nexport interface ChatMessage {\\n  id: string;\\n  sender: \'magician\' | \'user\';\\n  text: string;\\n  quickAction?: {\\n    type: \'reveal_secret\';\\n    label: string;\\n  };\\n  timestamp: string;\\n}\\n\\ninterface VirtualMagicianChatProps {\\n  messages: ChatMessage[];\\n  onSendMessage: (text: string) => Promise<void>;\\n  onRevealSecret: () => void;\\n  isGenerating: boolean;\\n  isSecretRevealed: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport const VirtualMagicianChat: React.FC<VirtualMagicianChatProps> = ({\\n  messages,\\n  onSendMessage,\\n  onRevealSecret,\\n  isGenerating,\\n  isSecretRevealed,\\n}) => {\\n  const [inputText, setInputText] = useState(\'\');\\n  const messagesEndRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\\n\\n  const scrollToBottom = () => {\\n    messagesEndRef.current?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n  };\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    scrollToBottom();\\n  }, [messages, isGenerating]);\\n\\n  const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    if (!inputText.trim() || isGenerating) return;\\n    const text = inputText.trim();\\n    setInputText(\'\');\\n    soundManager.playSelect(600);\\n    await onSendMessage(text);\\n  };\\n\\n  const presetQuestions = [\\n    \'\320\225\320\272\321\226\320\273\321\226\320\272 \321\201\320\260\320\275\320\260\321\203 \320\266\322\257\320\271\320\265\321\201\321\226 \320\264\320\265\320\263\320\265\320\275 \320\275\320\265?\',\\n    \'\320\235\320\265\320\263\320\265 16, 8, 4, 2, 1 \320\272\321\226\320\273\321\202\321\202\320\265\321\200\321\226?\',\\n    \'64-\320\272\320\265 \320\264\320\265\320\271\321\226\320\275 \322\233\320\260\320\273\320\260\320\271 \320\272\320\265\322\243\320\265\320\271\321\202\320\265\320\264\321\226?\',\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"flex flex-col h-[600px] rounded-2xl glass-panel-elevated border border-purple-500/30 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\\\">\\n      {/* Magician Header Bar */}\\n      <div className=\\\"p-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-950/80 via-[#111827]/90 to-cyan-950/80 border-b border-purple-900/50 flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-purple-600 to-cyan-400 p-[1.5px] magic-glow-purple\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"w-full h-full bg-[#0b0f19] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                <Bot className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-cyan-300\\\" />\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <span className=\\\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full border-2 border-[#0b0f19]\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-100\\\">\\n                \320\222\320\270\321\200\321\202\321\203\320\260\320\273\320\264\321\213 \320\241\320\270\322\233\321\213\321\200\321\210\321\213\\n              </span>\\n              <Sparkles className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-cyan-300/80 font-medium\\\">\\n              \320\226\320\230 \320\272\323\251\320\274\320\265\320\272\321\210\321\226\321\201\321\226 \302\267 \320\234\320\260\321\202\320\265\320\274\320\260\321\202\320\270\320\272\320\260\320\273\321\213\322\233 \321\201\320\270\322\233\321\213\321\200\321\210\321\213\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"text-right\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-purple-900/40 text-purple-300 border border-purple-700/40\\\">\\n            \320\236\320\275\320\273\320\260\320\271\320\275\\n          </span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Messages Stream */}\\n      <div className=\\\"grow overflow-y-auto p-4 space-y-3.5 bg-[#070b14]/50\\\">\\n        {messages.map((msg) => {\\n          const isMagician = msg.sender === \'magician\';\\n\\n          return (\\n            <div\\n              key={msg.id}\\n              className={`flex flex-col ${isMagician ? \'items-start\' : \'items-end\'}`}\\n            >\\n              <div\\n                className={`max-w-[88%] sm:max-w-[82%] rounded-2xl p-3 sm:p-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed transition-all ${\\n                  isMagician\\n                    ? \'bg-gradient-to-br from-[#161d33] to-[#0f172a] text-slate-100 border border-purple-500/30 rounded-tl-sm shadow-md\'\\n                    : \'bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-blue-600 text-white font-medium rounded-tr-sm shadow-md\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                {/* Formatted Message Content with markdown bolding */}\\n                <div className=\\\"whitespace-pre-wrap space-y-1\\\">\\n                  {msg.text.split(\'\\\\n\').map((line, idx) => {\\n                    return (\\n                      <p key={idx} className={line.startsWith(\'\342\234\250\') || line.startsWith(\'\360\237\224\256\') || line.startsWith(\'\360\237\214\237\') ? \'font-semibold text-amber-200\' : \'\'}>\\n                        {line}\\n                      </p>\\n                    );\\n                  })}\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Quick Action Button (Step 2: \302\253\320\230\323\231, \322\233\322\261\320\277\320\270\321\217\321\201\321\213\320\275 \320\260\321\210! \360\237\224\223\302\273) */}\\n                {msg.quickAction && msg.quickAction.type === \'reveal_secret\' && !isSecretRevealed && (\\n                  <div className=\\\"mt-3 pt-2.5 border-t border-purple-500/20\\\">\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => {\\n                        onRevealSecret();\\n                        soundManager.playSecretUnlock();\\n                      }}\\n                      className=\\\"w-full py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-amber-300 to-yellow-500 text-slate-950 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/25 hover:from-amber-300 hover:to-yellow-400 cursor-pointer transition-transform active:scale-98\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <Unlock className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-950\\\" />\\n                      <span>{msg.quickAction.label}</span>\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n                )}\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-1 px-1 font-mono\\\">\\n                {msg.timestamp}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n          );\\n        })}\\n\\n        {isGenerating && (\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-[#161d33] border border-purple-500/20 max-w-[70%]\\\">\\n            <Loader2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400 animate-spin\\\" />\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 italic\\\">\\n              \320\241\320\270\322\233\321\213\321\200\321\210\321\213 \320\276\320\271\320\273\320\260\320\275\321\213\320\277, \320\266\320\260\321\203\320\260\320\277 \320\266\320\260\320\267\321\203\320\264\320\260...\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n\\n        <div ref={messagesEndRef} />\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Suggested Quick Question Chips */}\\n      <div className=\\\"p-2.5 bg-[#0b0f19] border-t border-slate-800/80\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 overflow-x-auto pb-1 text-[11px]\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"text-slate-500 flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0 px-1\\\">\\n            <HelpCircle className=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-purple-400\\\" />\\n            \320\241\322\261\321\200\320\260\321\203:\\n          </span>\\n          {presetQuestions.map((q, idx) => (\\n            <button\\n              key={idx}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                onSendMessage(q);\\n                soundManager.playSelect(580);\\n              }}\\n              disabled={isGenerating}\\n              className=\\\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 hover:bg-purple-900/40 text-slate-300 hover:text-cyan-200 border border-slate-800 transition-colors shrink-0 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50\\\"\\n            >\\n              {q}\\n            </button>\\n          ))}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Input Field */}\\n      <form\\n        onSubmit={handleSubmit}\\n        className=\\\"p-3 bg-[#090d16] border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-2\\\"\\n      >\\n        <input\\n          type=\\\"text\\\"\\n          value={inputText}\\n          onChange={(e) => setInputText(e.target.value)}\\n          placeholder=\\\"\320\241\320\270\322\233\321\213\321\200\321\210\321\213\322\223\320\260 \321\201\322\261\321\200\320\260\322\233 \322\233\320\276\320\271\321\213\322\243\321\213\320\267 (\320\274\321\213\321\201\320\260\320\273\321\213: \320\265\320\272\321\226\320\273\321\226\320\272 \320\266\322\257\320\271\320\265 \320\264\320\265\320\263\320\265\320\275 \320\275\320\265?)...\\\"\\n          disabled={isGenerating}\\n          className=\\\"grow px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-700/80 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-100 placeholder-slate-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-cyan-400 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-400 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50\\\"\\n        />\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"submit\\\"\\n          disabled={!inputText.trim() || isGenerating}\\n          aria-label=\\\"\320\245\320\260\320\261\320\260\321\200\320\273\320\260\320\274\320\260 \320\266\321\226\320\261\320\265\321\200\321\203\\\"\\n          className=\\\"p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-cyan-500 text-white hover:opacity-90 transition-all cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed shrink-0\\\"\\n        >\\n          <Send className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n        </button>\\n      </form>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create VirtualMagicianChat component implementing 3 steps of interaction with typing animation and Gemini Q&A in Kazakh\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/VirtualMagicianChat.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating VirtualMagicianChat.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create VirtualMagicianChat.tsx component\"}"
